<title>AUSTRIA: Algeria says hopes OPEC rollover to have &quot;good effect&quot;.</title>
<headline>Algeria says hopes OPEC rollover to have &quot;good effect&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algerian oil minister Amar Makhloufi said on his return from the OPEC meeting on Thursday that he hoped the decision to rollover output for six months would have a &quot;good effect.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
